  "verified_evidence_files": 79,
  "verified_original_and_retained_source_files": 20,
  "source_findings": "The retained Kenney Furniture Kit 2.1 kitchenBar and Car Kit 3.1 sealed taped box match their acquired originals and both retained CC0 licenses. Complete source geometry, materials, textures and child transforms are preserved; four counter roots and one uniformly scaled parcel root form the scene. Neither source has animation clips.",
  "visual_findings": [
    "The broad pale raised surface, solid paneled front and L return identify a generic customer service counter. The staff-side recess is visible; the unobstructed foreground leaves room for customers.",
    "The small sealed parcel supports the current example without dominating the counter or indicating payment, refunds or order handoff. No register, text, logo or payment credentials appear.",
    "Root inspected the original counter rear view, sealed parcel front view, final 512x293 image and both native-scale and enlarged contacts covering all four actual minimum WordCard states.",
    "At the real 126x72 and144x74 card sizes, the front and L silhouette remain readable under the matched alpha/badge. The near-white top loses some edge contrast against white, but the complete service surface remains identifiable."
  ],
  "accepted_adaptations": [
    "Place and rotate complete counter model roots to form a broad three-section front and one return.",
    "Uniformly scale and place one complete licensed sealed parcel model on the surface.",
    "Use orthographic camera, restrained lighting, transparent rendering and content crop; preserve source geometry and materials."
  ],
  "production_delivery": "Pending exact approved-byte copy and production media-loader/crop/cache verification; scratch WordCard assignment is not production delivery.",
  "exclusions": [
